    "text": "As the card game's 20th anniversary approached, participants of Pokémon Card Gym events in Japan between August and October 2016 got basic Energy cards in a design based on the first series' Energy cards. Holo versions were the prize for three straight wins in the Premier Stage of the 20th Anniversary Festa's 20th Anniversary Battle.",
